---
description: Arsenal context optimization rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Use `.arsenal/` as the primary repo knowledge layer. Use `.cursor/knowledge-graph/` for curated route/task entry points.

Before editing:
- inspect `.arsenal/memory/active-task.md`
- inspect `.arsenal/repo-map.json` and relevant summaries
- check `.cursor/knowledge-graph/AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md` for task-specific entry points
- open only relevant source files

After editing:
- update active task
- update `.cursor/knowledge-graph/graph.json` if routes/pages/components changed
- run `npm run verify:kg` and `npm run verify:arsenal`
- run `npm run validate` and relevant e2e tests
